5. Alternatives if You Want Better Protocol Docs

The stock firmware protocol was fully reverse-engineered from USB sniffing — no official documentation exists. If you want a cleaner, fully-documented protocol, RadPro custom firmware has a published comm spec at github.com/Gissio/radpro/blob/main/docs/comm.md, but it requires flashing via an ST-Link V2 programmer with the device opened. For stock-only operation, the script above is your best path on Win10.
